{"schema_version":1,"page_number":20,"blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n��.2 一元二次方程的解法\n\n\n\n练习\n\n1. 填空：\n\n(1) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-2x+\\_\\=(x-\\_\\)^{2}","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":";\n\n(2) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}+8x+\\_\\=(x+\\_\\)^{2}","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":";\n\n(3) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-5x+\\_\\=(x-\\_\\)^{2}","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":";\n\n(4) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}+\\frac{3}{2}x+\\_\\=(x+\\_\\)^{2}.","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n2. 解下列方程：\n\n(1) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}+2x=3","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":";\n\n(2) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-6x=4","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":";\n\n(3) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}+10x+20=0","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":";\n\n(4) "},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-x-1=0","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":".\n\n\n\n当一元二次方程的二次项系数不是1时，怎样用配方法求解？\n\n把二次项系数化为1.\n\n例 4 解方程： "},{"type":"formula","latex":"2x^{2}-5x+2=0","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n解：两边都除以2，得\n\n"},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-\\frac{5}{2}x+1=0.","display":true},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n移项，得\n\n"},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-\\frac{5}{2}x=-1.","display":true},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n配方，得\n\n"},{"type":"formula","latex":"x^{2}-\\frac{5}{2}x+\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right)^{2}=-1+\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right)^{2},","display":true},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n"},{"type":"formula","latex":"\\left(x-\\frac{5}{4}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{9}{16}.","display":true},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n解这个方程，得\n\n"},{"type":"formula","latex":"x-\\frac{5}{4}=\\pm\\frac{3}{4}.","display":true},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n所以\n\n"},{"type":"formula","latex":"x_{1}=\\frac{1}{2},x_{2}=2.","display":true},{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n13"},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":81,"top":91,"right":190,"bottom":162},"source_order":0},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":78,"top":361,"right":186,"bottom":437},"source_order":1}],"termination":"eos","warnings":[]}